From 1c494bf67c6e42b9b2918f5cf5c904d77ea886b1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Weidong Sun <sunweidong@linux.alibaba.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 15:31:12 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] volumes: reuse the sandbox attachment map for container
 mounts

Resolve direct-volume records once before instance attachment and reuse
that disk/LUN mapping for each container. Retain mount properties from
the common transport, accept original upstream metadata, and leave
unrelated CSI mounts on the ordinary forwarding path. Bound file reads
and propagate malformed direct-volume errors before requesting attachment.

Signed-off-by: Weidong Sun <sunweidong@linux.alibaba.com>
Co-authored-by: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
